epeating table headers only.  a=dmeehan\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337717\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337960\n", "files": ["layout/base/nsCSSFrameConstructor.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-position/crashtests/top-layer-dialog-crash.html"], "git_node": "fb1c7397ae66b9ac047fa75b24e646a1e7030894", "git_parents": ["4c80ea6cf1643e706e7cccf2f0d2a09f8d3ed004"], "node": "75ae9e2c8181d69ce220c9130dbc74610c8d1733", "parents": ["3778ba81607fb2ad6d3c9c6bbd94464be408d2d3"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793279772, "git_changesets": ["fb1c7397ae66b9ac047fa75b24e646a1e7030894"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "29203": {"changesets": [{"author": "Maurice Dauer \u003cmdauer@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058035 - Ensure consistent block and offset,  a=dmeehan\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332855\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337982\n", "files": ["gfx/thebes/SharedFontList.cpp", "gfx/thebes/SharedFontList.h"], "git_node": "ff8d505f7f6a4db3b884b93523394ffa6ae0d2c5", "git_parents": ["fb1c7397ae66b9ac047fa75b24e646a1e7030894"], "node": "45c084ffa7013b5ce9a46410fe8b8e388f368e8b", "parents": ["75ae9e2c8181d69ce220c9130dbc74610c8d1733"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793281841, "git_changesets": ["ff8d505f7f6a4db3b884b93523394ffa6ae0d2c5"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "29204": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nika Layzell \u003cnika@thelayzells.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084673 - Simplify mojo dead proxy handling,  a=dmeehan\n\nPreviously, the mojo ports backend used a generic \"broadcast\" mechanism\nwhich was only ever used to broadcast a specific `ObserveProxy` message\nto signal a dead proxy. This specific message had special handling in\nevery place it was used within the ports code.\n\nThis makes the single use of the broadcast mechanism more explicit, by\nexplicitly limiting it to only support sending a `DeadProxy` message,\nand removing broadcast support from generic events.\n\nThis also fixes a minor bug in proxy handling where the broker process\nwould never be delivered the dead proxy notification itself, and the\nsending process would handle the dead proxy notification multiple times.\n\nChromium no longer uses this ports code upstream, so this divergence is\nnot an uplift concern. We are now the sole maintainers of this logic.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337281\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338042\n", "files": ["ipc/chromium/gtest/ports_unittest.cc", "ipc/chromium/src/mojo/core/ports/event.cc", "ipc/chromium/src/mojo/core/ports/event.h", "ipc/chromium/src/mojo/core/ports/node.cc", "ipc/chromium/src/mojo/core/ports/node.h", "ipc/chromium/src/mojo/core/ports/node_delegate.h", "ipc/glue/NodeChannel.cpp", "ipc/glue/NodeChannel.h", "ipc/glue/NodeController.cpp", "ipc/glue/NodeController.h", "ipc/glue/ProtocolUtils.h", "ipc/ipdl/ipdl.py", "tools/fuzzing/ipc/IPCFuzzController.cpp"], "git_node": "f57a4eab25654bc3f03ccd9a779a86d41821dc5c", "git_parents": ["ff8d505f7f6a4db3b884b93523394ffa6ae0d2c5"], "node": "061a46a5257b2f1d921e21e39a0b7cad5ed59ae7", "parents": ["45c084ffa7013b5ce9a46410fe8b8e388f368e8b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793293098, "git_changesets": ["f57a4eab25654bc3f03ccd9a779a86d41821dc5c"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "29205": {"changesets": [{"author": "Matthew Gregan \u003ckinetik@flim.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083629 - Pop the change index before performing block I/O in FileBlockCache.  a=dmeehan\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336984\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337788\n", "files": ["dom/media/FileBlockCache.cpp"], "git_node": "4784388d0839883dac30b685862f2f01e9bcd9bd", "git_parents": ["f57a4eab25654bc3f03ccd9a779a86d41821dc5c"], "node": "e260d3ba148dd7c975a124441605dcd5525a81b1", "parents": ["061a46a5257b2f1d921e21e39a0b7cad5ed59ae7"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793293166, "git_changesets": ["4784388d0839883dac30b685862f2f01e9bcd9bd"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "29206": {"changesets": [{"author": "Paul Adenot \u003cpaul@paul.cx\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2085650 - Back out bug 1972313 for stalling AAC metadata loading over the network.  a=dmeehan\n\nADTSTrackDemuxer::Init() scans up to 20000 frames with blocking reads, so\nloadedmetadata waits for several MB to download for any AAC file loaded over\nHTTP, and never fires for live streams advertising a fake Content-Length.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337912\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337916\n", "files": ["dom/media/ADTSDemuxer.cpp", "dom/media/ADTSDemuxer.h", "dom/media/gtest/TestADTSDemuxer.cpp"], "git_node": "99732766d54b0c74c8c319fe6358bee918dbe01c", "git_parents": ["4784388d0839883dac30b685862f2f01e9bcd9bd"], "node": "dc6e1db7056fd216405f221ea908e2b38fb6f34f", "parents": ["e260d3ba148dd7c975a124441605dcd5525a81b1"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793293256, "git_changesets": ["99732766d54b0c74c8c319fe6358bee918dbe01c"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "29207": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-beta repo-update remote-settings tld-suffixes ct-logs  a=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338127\n", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/ct/CTKnownLogs.h", "security/manager/tools/log_list.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/newtab-wallpapers-v2.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/onecrl.json"], "git_node": "fdea031b0ca9e6f88ffb011513ac8540870b5c39", "git_parents": ["99732766d54b0c74c8c319fe6358bee918dbe01c"], "node": "b9bec5294d26f2a