aths.\nOne way or the other, that doesn't seem enough.\n\n... Only single element property mutations have snapshots, so DOM mutations\nremain unchanged (... It's unlikely that this approach is correct for DOM\nmutations, anyway). That side could use an improvement as well, tracked in\nBug 2086739.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338425\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338678\n", "files": ["servo/components/selectors/matching.rs", "servo/components/style/invalidation/element/relative_selector.rs", "servo/ports/geckolib/glue.rs"], "git_node": "9a3864dd2794dcde5316553c8647ad846ffea94d", "git_parents": ["485a474610f0f67d0e67a6c9e6f54b0fcd0ac90b"], "node": "86cf9bcb06956bfde3220b226a51cff040958f94", "parents": ["92dadf59f6f80da4528e4289710b54f0657dd505"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793634090, "git_changesets": ["9a3864dd2794dcde5316553c8647ad846ffea94d"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "29258": {"changesets": [{"author": "Edgar Chen \u003cechen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2086767 - Save the directory instead of the file as the last temporary add-on location in about:debugging;  a=dmeehan\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338013\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338727\n", "files": ["devtools/client/aboutdebugging/src/modules/extensions-helper.js", "devtools/client/aboutdebugging/test/browser/browser_aboutdebugging_addons_temporary_install_path.js"], "git_node": "dd694309116f0840bc2bc3b702381337865a269f", "git_parents": ["9a3864dd2794dcde5316553c8647ad846ffea94d"], "node": "3f8ec0075b384e54bf9062a15b584265fe640745", "parents": ["86cf9bcb06956bfde3220b226a51cff040958f94"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793634396, "git_changesets": ["dd694309116f0840bc2bc3b702381337865a269f"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "29259": {"changesets": [{"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@intuitionlibrary.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2086296 - Keep destroyed actors queued with deferred destroy commands in offscreen WebRender transactions.  a=dmeehan\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338178\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338630\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/wr/WebRenderBridgeChild.cpp"], "git_node": "15291c411bff6d54a80d7a5dcad04bb664fcc393", "git_parents": ["dd694309116f0840bc2bc3b702381337865a269f"], "node": "86e49d8959145f4e2a150923a52d48e9e6ce0ac9", "parents": ["3f8ec0075b384e54bf9062a15b584265fe640745"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793634512, "git_changesets": ["15291c411bff6d54a80d7a5dcad04bb664fcc393"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "29260": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 579b0acf3f0ad29a689eae3dc55b0027797fc6b3 with FIREFOX_160_0b4_RELEASE a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "fe17f7fac7269b2c43a28984866fced8f55efa00", "git_parents": ["9fcfea654bcf4a2bf1d0eb1c6e90782debf17498"], "node": "149b3a3b3b38c3334c1d731db1634047fbfbe3b6", "parents": ["342a21d5ba27816495e6f13a7dd0b8fceb870a61"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793636985, "git_changesets": ["fe17f7fac7269b2c43a28984866fced8f55efa00"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "29261": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jon Coppeard \u003cjcoppeard@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079689 - Ensure WeakRef targets are added to the CC graph  a=dmeehan\n\nWe already clear WeakRef targets for GC things that are white in the CC graph,\nbut not all GC things are represented in the CC graph and if the node is\nmissing then this check will fail. There are several reasons for GC things to\nbe missing: they might be garbage or they just might not have been considered\nby the CC.\n\nThe patch ensures WeakRef targets are present in the CC graph at the start so\nwe can get an accurate result. Only objects are added. Symbols must be used as\nWeakMap keys to be part of a gray cycle and these keys are already added to the\nCC graph.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337944\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338791\n", "files": ["js/public/friend/CycleCollector.h", "js/src/gc/FinalizationObservers.cpp", "js/src/gc/FinalizationObservers.h", "js/src/gc/GCRuntime.h", "xpcom/base/CycleCollectedJSRuntime.cpp"], "git_node": "90a12ed4567d91b8e83559941aa3be0339335336", "git_parents": ["15291c411bff6d54a80d7a5dcad04bb664fcc393"], "node": "617cfe1303e2e326fdcaaa5713391a62b1b0d53d", "parents": ["86e49d8959145f4e2a150923a52d48e9e6ce0ac9"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793637042, "git_changesets": ["90a12ed4567d91b8e83559941aa3be0339335336"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "29262": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 7b34a03a910d0385299f4a9f27aa585a786862d8 with FIREFOX-ANDROID_159_0_1_BUILD1 a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "04d0079e492c559f346688a0d59e221c30c2e6be", "git_parents": ["fe17f7fac7269b2c43a28984866fced8f55efa00"], "node": "cad680e03c3ad843775e07750b28a837bff1162e", "parents": ["149b3a3b3b38c3334c1d731db1634047fbfbe3b6"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793641966, "git_changesets": ["04d0079e492c559f346688a0d59e221c30c2e6be"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "29263": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 7b34a03a910d0385299f4a9f27aa585a786862d8 with FIREFOX_159_0_1_BUILD1 a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "38a54df3100477cf389c905b3a28924857b39817", "git_parents": ["04d0079e492c559f346688a0d59e221c30c2e6be"], "node": "764bd5c9f3c1c4938958740545f0091680e28c98", "parents": ["cad680e03c3ad843775e07750b28a837bff1162e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793642033, "git_changesets": ["38a54df3100477cf389c905b3a28924857b39817"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"