/D334346\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338804\n", "files": ["dom/cookiestore/CookieStore.cpp", "dom/cookiestore/CookieStoreManager.cpp", "dom/serviceworkers/ServiceWorkerRegistration.cpp"], "git_node": "5d686ca2a3fadd2216e0e51be22d2bc1f3236901", "git_parents": ["4adfe4ccc2f0f82ace90ab8009772302552b8a0f"], "node": "79cc8a657da1423dda9409c2206f29f05daeb279", "parents": ["f111b5ded7df5ad3f095b716ba6ae492e30ddddd"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793712570, "git_changesets": ["4adfe4ccc2f0f82ace90ab8009772302552b8a0f", "5d686ca2a3fadd2216e0e51be22d2bc1f3236901"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "29271": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 7b34a03a910d0385299f4a9f27aa585a786862d8 with FIREFOX_159_0_1_RELEASE a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "7133d65e91b1290e3924232fbf739ded6f09c516", "git_parents": ["38a54df3100477cf389c905b3a28924857b39817"], "node": "4fc509c5ec21bc1201dca5ed88fd188ce1a9e0bd", "parents": ["764bd5c9f3c1c4938958740545f0091680e28c98"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793714834, "git_changesets": ["7133d65e91b1290e3924232fbf739ded6f09c516"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "29272": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 7b34a03a910d0385299f4a9f27aa585a786862d8 with FIREFOX-ANDROID_159_0_1_RELEASE a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "9283e2d4c366e8b449856a145652134a6de6238c", "git_parents": ["7133d65e91b1290e3924232fbf739ded6f09c516"], "node": "2c8f31ffeea127e33007b3f6cf58f8316a8c56f6", "parents": ["4fc509c5ec21bc1201dca5ed88fd188ce1a9e0bd"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793715221, "git_changesets": ["9283e2d4c366e8b449856a145652134a6de6238c"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "29273": {"changesets": [{"author": "Harrison Oglesby \u003coglesby.harrison@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087663 - Catch RejectedExecutionException when closing an unused capture session in QrFragment.  a=dmeehan\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338811\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338882\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/qr/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/qr/QrFragment.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/qr/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/qr/QrFragmentTest.kt"], "git_node": "65105fba7d2185e36dcb48cdb5360d4be98700a8", "git_parents": ["5d686ca2a3fadd2216e0e51be22d2bc1f3236901"], "node": "e056fc728eb25fda8398cd12291f9201437e0b11", "parents": ["79cc8a657da1423dda9409c2206f29f05daeb279"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793715883, "git_changesets": ["65105fba7d2185e36dcb48cdb5360d4be98700a8"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "29274": {"changesets": [{"author": "Daniel Holbert \u003cdholbert@cs.stanford.edu\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081288: Rewrite crashtest 2075414.html to do its work in an iframe.  a=dmeehan\n\nBefore this patch, the crashtest 2075414.html reloads itself, which is not\nsomething that the reftest harness robustly handles (particularly for\n\"reftest-wait\" tests).  When a test needs to do that, we typically handle it by\nputting put the main guts of the test an iframe which can freely navigate,\nwhich gets hosted by a lightweight outer document that waits for a signal from\nthe inner document before declaring the test done.\n\nThis patch does that for this crashtest -- just moving the existing crashtest\nto now be 2075414-frame.html, and creating a new lightweight 2075414.html to\nhost it in an iframe and maintain the \"reftest-wait\" is-the-test-done state.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336047\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D339218\n", "files": ["docshell/base/crashtests/2075414-frame.html", "docshell/base/crashtests/2075414.html"], "gi